        "title": "Schema-1 rejection reasons are undecidable inside T1's write set.** Confidence: MEDIUM. §4 maps reasons \"from sentinel\" and AC1-2 asserts checksum→checksum_mismatch, but `Load`'s legacy branch returns one error for all `decodeSnapshotV1` failures (`snapshot_v1.go:135-157`) and T1's exact files exclude `snapshot_v1.go`; whichever sentinel wraps that branch mislabels the other class. Fix: declare schema-1 failures `corrupt_json` (checksum_mismatch schema-2 only) or widen T1 with typed legacy sentinels plus a schema-1 AC case.",
